</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>All of God’s power for His creation,</l><l>And all His might in incarnation,</l><l>Strength to be crucified</l><l>Which by the power of God was supplied.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>And His great power in resurrection,</l><l>He wrought in Christ, even ascension!</l><l>All things He has subdued</l><l>Under His feet, by power overruled.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Now in the church, in God’s transmission,</l><l>All that He is, to His destination,</l><l>Here constantly receive.</l><l>He is dispensed to us who believe.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>The Triune God is now transmitting</l><l>Himself, this power, us energizing,</l><l>In us He is installed;</l><l>This dynamo within, the Triune God!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
